 "remarks": "Welcome to 21 Surrey Drive, a thoughtfully cared-for four-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath raised ranch offering 3,046 square feet on a quiet, tree-lined street right near the Westport town line in Norwalk. Inside, rich red oak solid wood flooring spans the main level, setting a warm, grounded tone from the moment you step through the new front entry door with updated side lighting. The primary suite features an upgraded bathroom shower, while central air installed in 2017 keeps every season comfortable. Major mechanical and exterior investments have already been handled for you, including a 2019 asphalt roof, 2021 rooftop solar panels that substantially reduce monthly electric costs. Step outside to a backyard designed for everyday living and warm-weather gatherings. Surrounded by a 2022 vinyl privacy fence, the yard features a 2023 above-ground swimming pool with a landscaped surround, a 2024 composite deck with weathertight under-deck storage, and an adjoining stone patio. Lush grass from a full 2025 lawn renovation-seeded with GCI Turf Type Tall Fescue and supported by a 2017 in-ground sprinkler system-frames the entire space. Conveniently situated just minutes from local shops, restaurants, theater, and fitness centers, with effortless access to both I-95 and the Merritt Parkway, 21 Surrey Drive blends neighborly charm with practical modern upgrades.",
